      "title": "The flaky search box",
      "scenario": "A search box calls `fetch('/api/search?q=' + input.value)` on every `input` event and renders the results list when each response arrives.\n\nUsers type quickly. Sometimes the list shows results for an older query than the text in the box. The server is healthy: slow and fast responses simply arrive in a different order than the requests were sent."
